<title>FRANCE: Cogema H1 net profit rises, sees higher 96 profit.</title>
<headline>Cogema H1 net profit rises, sees higher 96 profit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     575		   546</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		   942  vs	     887</p>
<p>    Net investments			    2,383  vs	   2,957</p>
<p>    Turnover				    16,408  vs	  14,877</p>
<p>NOTE - State-owned nuclear materials group Cogema gave the figures in a statement.</p>
<p>It also forecast a rise in profit for full year 1996. &quot;Barring unforeseen events, results for 1996 may rise over those of the previous year,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Cogema reported net profit of 973 million francs for 1995.</p>
</text>
